1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,236
Count carbons.

2
00:00:01,236 --> 00:00:07,395
Start with three molecules of RuBP, a five-carbon sugar: fifteen carbons.

3
00:00:07,395 --> 00:00:10,690
Three carbon dioxide arrive: three more.

4
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:20,494
The enzyme RuBisCO joins them, and each unstable six-carbon product splits at once into two molecules of 3-PGA.

5
00:00:20,494 --> 00:00:24,062
Six 3-PGA: eighteen carbons.

6
00:00:24,062 --> 00:00:25,247
Nothing lost.

